{"_id": "seed-doc-getting-started", "_type": "doc", "title": "Getting started", "description": "What Turbo Start Brain is, what you get out of the box, and where to go first.", "slug": {"_type": "slug", "current": "/getting-started"}, "order": 0, "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0006", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0001", "text": "Turbo Start Brain is a documentation and knowledge base template: a ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0002", "text": "Next.js", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0003", "text": " docs site and a ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0004", "text": "Sanity Studio", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0005", "text": " in one monorepo. Every page, the home page and the site settings are edited in Studio, and the site rebuilds itself as you publish.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0008", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0007", "text": "What you get", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0010", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0009", "text": "A sidebar built from your pages, nested by slug", "marks": []}], "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0012", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0011", "text": "Search across titles, descriptions and body text", "marks": []}], "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0016", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0013", "text": "A Markdown version of every page for LLMs and agents: add ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0014", "text": ".md", "marks": ["code"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0015", "text": " to any URL", "marks": []}], "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0018", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key