{"_id": "seed-doc-getting-started-environment-variables", "_type": "doc", "title": "Environment variables", "description": "The variables each app needs, which are optional, and where to find the values.", "slug": {"_type": "slug", "current": "/getting-started/environment-variables"}, "order": 2, "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0061", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0058", "text": "Each app reads its own ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0059", "text": ".env", "marks": ["code"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0060", "text": " file. The web app validates its variables at startup and refuses to start if a required one is missing.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "code", "_key": "k0062", "language": "bash", "code": "cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env\ncp apps/studio/.env.example apps/studio/.env", "filename": "terminal"}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0064", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0063", "text": "Web app", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "code", "_key": "k0065", "language": "text", "code": "NEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_DATASET=production\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_API_VERSION=2025-05-08\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SANITY_STUDIO_URL=http://localhost:3333\nSANITY_API_READ_TOKEN=your-viewer-token", "filename": "apps/web/.env"}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0067", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0066", "text": "Studio", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "code", "_key": "k0068", "language": "text", "code": "SANITY_STUDIO_PROJECT_ID=your-project-id\nSANITY_STUDIO_DATASET=production", "filename": "apps/studio/.env"}, {"_type": "callout", "_key": "k0069", "variant": "danger", "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0073", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0070", "text": "Never commit ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0071", "text": ".env", "marks": ["code"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key