{"_id": "seed-doc-writing-docs-page-structure", "_type": "doc", "title": "Page structure", "description": "Headings, lists and quotes, and how they shape the table of contents.", "slug": {"_type": "slug", "current": "/writing-docs/page-structure"}, "order": 0, "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0114", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0113", "text": "Start every page with the answer, then the detail. Readers scan before they read.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0116", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0115", "text": "Headings", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0122", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0117", "text": "Use ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0118", "text": "H2", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0119", "text": " for sections and ", "marks": []}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0120", "text": "H3", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"_type": "span", "_key": "k0121", "text": " for sub-sections. Both appear in the table of contents on the right; H4 and below do not.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0124", "style": "h3", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0123", "text": "Keep them short", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0126", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0125", "text": "A heading should say what the section covers in a few words, so the table of contents doubles as a summary.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0128", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0127", "text": "Lists", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0130", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0129", "text": "Bullets for items in no particular order", "marks": []}], "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0132", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0131", "text": "Numbers for anything done in sequence", "marks": []}], "listItem": "bullet", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0134", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0133", "text": "Write the title", "marks": []}], "listItem": "number", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0136", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0135", "text": "Write the description", "marks": []}], "listItem": "number", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0138", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0137", "text": "Fill the sections", "marks": []}], "listItem": "number", "level": 1}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0140", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0139", "text": "Quotes", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0142", "style": "blockquote", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0141", "text": "Write the page you would want when something is on fire: the fix first, the background after.", "marks": []}]}]}
{"_id": "seed-doc-writing-docs-code-and-callouts", "_type": "doc", "title": "Code and callouts", "description": "Code blocks with filenames and syntax colours, and the four callout variants.", "slug": {"_type": "slug", "current": "/writing-docs/code-and-callouts"}, "order": 1, "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0144", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0143", "text": "Code blocks", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0146", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0145", "text": "Pick a language to get syntax colours and the right fence in the Markdown version. Add a filename when the reader needs to know where the code goes.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "code", "_key": "k0147", "language": "ts", "code": "export function greet(name: string): string {\n  return `Hello, ${name}`;\n}", "filename": "lib/greet.ts"}, {"_type": "code", "_key": "k0148", "language": "python", "code": "def greet(name: str) -> str:\n    return f\"Hello, {name}\""}, {"_type": "code", "_key": "k0149", "language": "yaml", "code": "site:\n  title: Docs\n  search: true", "filename": "config.yml"}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0151", "style": "h2", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0150", "text": "Callouts", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "block", "_key": "k0153", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0152", "text": "Callouts pull one fact out of the flow. Pick the variant by consequence.", "marks": []}]}, {"_type": "callout", "_key": "k0154", "variant": "info", "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0156", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0155", "text": "Info: context that helps but is not required.", "marks": []}]}]}, {"_type": "callout", "_key": "k0157", "variant": "warning", "body": [{"_type": "block", "_key": "k0159", "style": "normal", "markDefs": [], "children": [{"_type": "span", "_key": "k0158", "text": "Warning: